\hat{r}_{12} is the unit vector along \overline{BA}, away from A. \vec{F}_{12} acts on q_1at A and is directed along BA, away from A. The unit vectors \hat{r}_{12} and \hat{r}_{21} are oppositely directed i.e., \hat{r}_{12} = -\hat{r}_{21} hence,
